# The V7 spec is a delivered artefact, not source we edit. Git's automatic
# line-ending conversion would rewrite it on checkout, so the working copy would
# no longer be byte-identical to what the client sent — and
# tests/unit/spec-freshness.test.ts compares exactly those bytes. `-text`
# disables the conversion in both directions and stores it verbatim.
spec/v7/*.html -text
